    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >SSR Summoners is a turnbased combat online idle fantasy RPG, featuring the Gacha system, allowing players to summon powerful heroes and rare characters to build their ultimate team. Set in a rich, fantasy world, the game combines strategic gameplay with an engaging storyline, offering both offline and online progression. The Gacha system enhances the experience, providing a constant stream of new characters to collect and upgrade. With its blend of immersive combat, captivating quests, and idle mechanics, SSR Summoners delivers a rewarding experience for all types of players.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summon and Unleash the Power of SSR Heroes</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on Epic Quests and Challenges</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build and Dominate with Strategic Formations</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unite in Guild Battles</p>",
